 report writer.</p></div>
    <div class=3D"comp c4"><div class=3D"ic">=F0=9F=A4=96</div><span class=
=3D"n">2 agents</span><h3>Custom agents</h3>
      <p><code>.agent.md</code> personas: Test Planner, Test Healer, read-o=
nly Reviewer.</p></div>
    <div class=3D"comp c5"><div class=3D"ic">=F0=9F=94=8C</div><span class=
=3D"n">2 servers</span><h3>MCP servers</h3>
      <p>Tools your agents can call: Playwright MCP plus one more (GitHub, =
docs, files).</p></div>
    <div class=3D"comp c6"><div class=3D"ic">=F0=9F=AA=9D</div><span class=
=3D"n">2 hooks</span><h3>Hooks</h3>
      <p>Guardrails in <code>hooks.json</code>: block <code>.only</code>, r=
un lint after edits.</p></div>
  </div>

  <h2>=E2=8F=B1=EF=B8=8F The 90-minute game plan<small>Stick to the clock, =
demo beats perfect</small></h2>
  <div class=3D"timeline">
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">0=E2=80=9310</div><div><b>Setup=
 &amp; recon</b><span>Open QA Mart, list 3 flows to protect (login, cart, c=
heckout).</span></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">10=E2=80=9325</div><div><b>Inst=
ructions + prompts</b><span>Write 2 rule files and 2 slash prompts. Test ea=
ch once.</span></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">25=E2=80=9345</div><div><b>Skil=
ls + agents</b><span>2 skills with clear descriptions, 2 agents with tight =
tool lists.</span></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">45=E2=80=9360</div><div><b>MCP =
+ hooks</b><span>Wire Playwright MCP and one more. Add 2 safety hooks.</spa=
n></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">60=E2=80=9375</div><div><b>Pack=
age</b><span>Create <code>plugin.json</code>, point it at every component.<=
/span></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">75=E2=80=9390</div><div><b>Inst=
all &amp; demo</b><span>Install from your repo, run one end-to-end test, sh=
are the link.</span></div></div>
  </div>

