></div>

  <h2>=F0=9F=9A=80 Publish &amp; prove it<small>Distribution is half the sk=
ill</small></h2>
  <div class=3D"timeline">
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">1</div><div><b>Push to GitHub</=
b><span>Public repo with the plugin folder at a clear path.</span></div></d=
iv>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">2</div><div><b>Add a marketplac=
e file (bonus)</b><span>A <code>marketplace.json</code> lets teammates brow=
se and install by name.</span></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">3</div><div><b>Install on a cle=
