 isn=E2=80=99t done.</span></div></div>
    <div class=3D"step"><div class=3D"time">4</div><div><b>Verify everythin=
g loaded</b><span>Check agents, skills and MCP servers appear. Run one prom=
pt end to end.</span></div></div>
  </div>

