    <div class=3D"chk"><i></i><span>2 hooks that fire and do something usef=
ul</span></div>
    <div class=3D"chk"><i></i><span>Plugin installs cleanly and generates o=
ne real QA Mart test</span></div>
    <div class=3D"chk"><i></i><span>README with install command and a 60-se=
